    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this demo",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 69,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Scope:** business panels cover the selected deployment; the service selector filters HTTP health and application logs. Kubernetes panels use the namespace selector. AI metrics use the SDK cluster tag.\n\n**Expected demo failures:** optional traffic deliberately injects catalog 500s/latency and chat failures. These are included in the charts, not hidden. Default baseline traffic does not inject faults or call a paid model.\n\n**Signal boundaries:** use the Traces and Profiles links for those native signals, and Frontend Observability for Faro/browser experience. No Web Vitals, AI evaluation scores, model costs or customer SLOs are fabricated here. Missing optional signals are not converted to healthy zeroes."
      }
